{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"PushwooshNotificationUI","externalID":"PushwooshNotificationUI","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshNotificationUI"}],"symbolKind":"module"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A ready-made full-screen “stories” UI for an expanded push notification."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Stories UI","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/StoryPage"],"title":"Payload model"},{"title":"Analytics","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesDelegate"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher"],"title":"Media pre-cache"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — a drop-in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNNotificationContentExtension","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to your memory-constrained extension process.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Usage","text":"Usage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In your Notification Content Extension:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PW_STORIES"},{"text":" (must match ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio"},{"text":" = e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1.5"},{"text":" (keep in sync with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (code-only, no storyboard)"}]}]}]},{"text":"Payload","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Payload"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stories are described by a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pw_stories"},{"type":"text","text":" block, alongside an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"matching "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory"},{"type":"text","text":". The parser accepts the block either at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"payload root","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"type":"text","text":") or inside the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom-data container "},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (the Pushwoosh API "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"text":" field — delivered as","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sent through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"text":"), the same block arrives nested under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"text":" — while ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mutable-content"},{"text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params.aps"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so both delivery styles work"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and old pushes keep rendering."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every field except "},{"code":"image","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is optional. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"link"},{"type":"text","text":" (like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"type":"text","text":") must include a URL"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Analytics","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storiesDelegate","type":"reference"},{"text":" to observe lifecycle and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"engagement and forward it to your analytics (the module itself sends nothing):","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController, PushwooshStoriesDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        storiesDelegate = self","    }","    func storiesViewController(_ c: PushwooshStoriesViewController, didTapActionFor page: StoryPage, at index: Int) {","        \/\/ forward the per-page click to your backend","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Instant--offline-first-frame-App-Group-pre-cache","level":2,"text":"Instant \/ offline first frame (App Group pre-cache)"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make the first frame appear instantly (and offline), pre-download the media in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a Notification "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Service"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Extension into a shared App Group container that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Content Extension reads from:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Groups"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" capability (same id) on both the Service and Content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"extensions, and override "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From the Service Extension’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)"},{"text":", call","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher\/prefetch(userInfo:appGroupIdentifier:completion:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Send the push with "},{"code":"mutable-content: 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the Service Extension runs."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without this, the module still works — images download on display instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI/documentation/PushwooshNotificationUI/PushwooshStoriesViewController/appGroupIdentifier":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"appGroupIdentifier","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"appGroupIdentifier","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui\/pushwooshstoriesviewcontroller\/appgroupidentifier","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"App Group identifier shared with your Notification Service Extension. When set (and the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"capability is enabled on both targets), the first frame is read from the shared container"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that the Service Extension pre-warmed — instant and offline. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" (uses ","type":"text"},{"code":"tmp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI/documentation/PushwooshNotificationUI/PushwooshStoriesDelegate":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshStoriesDelegate"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesDelegate","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional analytics \/ lifecycle hooks for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshStoriesDelegate","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui\/pushwooshstoriesdelegate","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshStoriesDelegate"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI/documentation/PushwooshNotificationUI/PushwooshNotificationUIVersionString":{"kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshNotificationUIVersionString","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui\/pushwooshnotificationuiversionstring","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshNotificationUIVersionString","fragments":[{"text":"PushwooshNotificationUIVersionString","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Project version string for PushwooshNotificationUI."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI/docu